Comment: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:46.60,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:12.63,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:12.36,Default,Singing,0000,0000,0000,,Underneath the blue, blue sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:21.66,Default,Singing,0000,0000,0000,,amongst the soft grass of the riverbank,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:27.28,Default,Singing,0000,0000,0000,,let's play a game of hide and seek,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:32.09,Default,Singing,0000,0000,0000,,in the midst of the sunflower fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:42.11,Default,Singing,0000,0000,0000,,Let's send a soap bubble to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:23.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Chase after those white, white clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:30.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Run, run...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.65,0:02:34.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You've been energetic all morning even though it's terribly hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What song is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's one I learned from Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:40.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's such a fun song, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:45.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,From the top of the great mountains{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:06.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I was going to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:07.41,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're too loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:10.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.99,0:03:13.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing this early on a Sunday morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:17.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Airing out the futon! Seeing how it's so nice out today and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:24.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you do anything without causing such a commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:27.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:32.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do-ba-to!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.09,0:03:35.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,"Are you okay"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:37.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:42.78,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a stuffed animal right now!\NI can't be doing things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:45.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:45.70,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:49.44,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:50.11,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:54.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose just said goodbye to Fujimoto, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.86,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:58.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:03:59.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:03.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When I was talking to him, he was next door. Now he's already out the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.97,0:04:06.22,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He's a busy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:13.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are two Fujimotos?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:17.66,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a mystery story!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:23.82,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:24.99,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,What was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.73,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:35.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you have today off, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:39.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go air out the futons for them because it's such a nice day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:42.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, do you really understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Understand what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:47.52,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:51.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In order to fill up the bottle with konpeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:56.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Since you understand, don't you think you have other things that you should be doing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:04:58.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:12.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,For now, I want to try and help Yomogi Nursery. Even if I can only help a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:15.40,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Reporting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:20.09,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently the previous head of Yomogi Nursery was tricked and forced to borrow a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:22.34,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The previous head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:28.05,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka Okiura's father. He passed away two years ago or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:31.42,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,The ones who tricked him were pretty dangerous guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:36.10,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,and now they're harassing Sayaka Okiura as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:55.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:57.92,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:03.51,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter? We're not open today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:06.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but I came to air out the futons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:09.22,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The futons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:12.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! The weather is just perfect for it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:24.78,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It really is a nice day out today...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:27.53,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I totally didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:32.28,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right then. Let's air them out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:34.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:42.42,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose's really glad she managed to get such a good tenant like you to stay at her place, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:43.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really glad things worked out too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.78,0:06:47.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's so much fun to be with Chitose, Chiho and Chise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:50.38,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,How about Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.43,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Has he been... picking on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:58.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto does pick on me sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But there are times he doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:04.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't understand what\Nkind of person Fujimoto is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:10.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He might not look like it,\Nbut Fujimoto's a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.66,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He's always been like that, even when he was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Little Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:19.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.73,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.13,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:30.23,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.07,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:34.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's so little!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:37.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is this really Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:41.64,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. This picture was taken on\NFujimoto's first day at the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:46.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto was a student here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.94,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:53.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.95,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,An orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:58.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,An orphan? What does orphan mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:04.17,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,A child who doesn't have a father or mother or family anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:09.42,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't have the resolve to see it all the way through, don't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:13.08,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just showing that you care about him for your own self-satisfaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:14.68,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,then you're the same as the owner who abandoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,...he said stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:21.08,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:26.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know more about Fujimoto as a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.94,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.82,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's already been\Nfourteen years since then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:41.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Since my father took in Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.33,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:48.23,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,This is the child I was talking about before, Kiyokazu Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:52.98,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu, this is my daughter, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:56.22,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Sayaka. It's nice to meet you, Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:05.04,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,T-That's right! Let's take a picture to commemorate this day, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.85,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:09.40,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,Camera, camera, where is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:15.36,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:20.37,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,Say Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:26.46,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's been living here ever since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:29.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like he's angry in this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:34.18,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,When he first came here,\Nhe always looked like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:36.88,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He wouldn't speak to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:39.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not even you, Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:43.17,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Even me. He was always by himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:49.62,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I even introduced him to the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:53.00,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,In the beginning, everyone was\Nreally interested in meeting him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.50,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,but since Fujimoto didn't\Nshow interest in any of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.82,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,they eventually all stopped\Ntrying to be friends with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:07.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Even at school, it didn't seem like Fujimoto had any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:14.50,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He gave off an aura of "don't come close to me", so perhaps that was unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:18.13,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:25.21,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try telling her "I'm home"!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.47,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:28.59,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:32.94,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:35.94,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye! See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:56.09,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu... do you like the organ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:00.10,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:15.89,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye, Miss Sayaka! See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:20.07,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.36,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:06.85,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious cold beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:09.66,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Try some for free today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:11.42,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Can I get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:12.41,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.84,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Would anyone like a delicious beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.96,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Special promotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:20.23,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,May I have one of these please?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:22.59,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes. It's a new product.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:24.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Please try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:27.62,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:30.06,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Shuichiro will love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:44.53,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,On a summer day like today,\Nwhen the weather was so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.53,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,It's my turn next!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.66,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm next!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:51.87,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,You just went, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:53.66,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Come now, no fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.57,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure everyone gets a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:55.79,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:58.79,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Will they bloom soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:04.51,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they'll bloom beautifully since\Neveryone's taking such good care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.89,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:07.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:08.50,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:12.03,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Now everyone, make sure you clean up first before going to play, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:13.80,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:27.82,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:39.13,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Tomo, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:44.27,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,The ball suddenly flew over and\Nsurprised her, that's why she fell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:48.49,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:50.14,Default Alt,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt anywhere? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:57.77,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,What're you pushing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:58.73,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:01.02,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think you'd actually fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:02.69,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Stop messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:04.53,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,I'm covered in dirt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:06.94,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, just hurry up and get the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:08.93,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who missed the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:10.74,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:15.41,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Damn... Why is it so wet here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:19.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What do you guys think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:22.67,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, our ball flew in here{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:24.31,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think playing like that is dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:26.01,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You just hit her with the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:28.35,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,We did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:29.68,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,What're you so angry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:31.85,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and get out of the garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:32.72,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:37.73,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone planted the sunflowers here\Ntogether and took really good care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:40.94,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,They're just about to bloom and everyone was really looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.80,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Here's your ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:53.46,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Apologize to this girl, to everyone, and then leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:08.36,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,O-Our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:09.59,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:14.08,Default,Dude 2,0000,0000,0000,,Your return was way too wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:16.05,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Then you shouldn't have passed me the ball there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.22,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.74,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,The sunflower...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:41.00,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. It just got a little hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:50.59,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,If we support it like this, and make sure we water it everyday,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:51.86,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it'll still bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:53.10,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:53.60,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:20.83,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Chase after the white, white clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:30.93,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Run, run, with your friends by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:35.86,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,You can see everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:40.97,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,from the top of the great mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:45.48,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Search, keep searching...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:50.15,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,For new wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:58.95,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know that Fujimoto is doing all sorts of part time work right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:16:59.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:05.81,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,PIzza delivery, bicycle repair,\Nnewspaper delivery... and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:07.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So many?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:12.80,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. He's working really hard to try and pay off even a little bit of the Nursery's debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:16.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,For the Nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:20.81,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. He says he's going to become a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:27.52,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He studies so late every night.\NI'm afraid he's going to wreck his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:45.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They're so fluffy and smell so fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:48.00,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The smell of sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sunshine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:50.09,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.81,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Futons smell like sunshine after you air them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:57.59,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Or at least that's what my father used to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:04.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then tomorrow everyone can\Ntake a nap with Mr. Sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:07.64,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I guess they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:10.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,D-Did I say something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:13.47,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, not at all. I think that's a beautiful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Phew. Then I'm looking forward to tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:18.19,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take them down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:27.08,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for helping today. Get home safely, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:29.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'll see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:34.69,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Sunshine, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:41.42,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:42.76,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:45.02,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Could you play the organ again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.58,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Please play!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:47.78,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.35,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.55,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:52.05,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.99,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:06.45,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I... I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:09.74,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu, the organ, the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:11.18,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:24.47,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,You can see the red, red sunset now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:34.27,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Walk, walk, keep on walking steadily forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:38.78,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,If it's sunny tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:43.59,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,come back over and play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:50.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Time to go home, time to go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:55.12,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Home is right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:59.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at that! You haven't\Ncollected any more, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:06.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But, but, I wanted to air out the futons and help out the Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:09.05,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You managed to air me out too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.05,0:20:10.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:13.02,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:16.56,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it was you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:22.12,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect timing. I was just about to take this over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.73,0:20:27.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,C-Can I really have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:32.54,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yup! I still have one for Shuichiro in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:33.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'll take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:36.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that great, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, here I go! All in one gulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:44.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Actually wait! I'll restrain myself now so I can really enjoy it before bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:52.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're always so careful about watering all of the greenery in the garden, Kohaku. It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:57.23,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,This is about all I can do for Shuichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:21:02.20,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I can only help a little, but being able to help him in any way makes me very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:06.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! If I can help out Yomogi\NNursery, it makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:11.52,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Being able to help out the people important to you is a great thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:14.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Important people...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:24.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The Nursery is really\Nimportant to Fujimoto, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:29.20,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, even to the point where he's\Ndoing multiple jobs to help support it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:33.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I feel that way too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:38.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The Nursery is really important to me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:43.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll work hard so I can help out Miss Sayaka and everyone too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:47.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:51.05,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like you're headed in the wrong direction again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:19.73,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.04,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:22.38,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:24.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:25.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:28.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, you were really cute when you were little!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:35.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And even though your legs were too short,\Nyou did your best to play the organ, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:37.91,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:41.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka showed me pictures today!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:43.21,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.21,0:22:44.09,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.09,0:22:46.63,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see little Fujimoto too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.63,0:22:47.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Not you too, Chitose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:50.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He was so little and cute, but still grumpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:51.24,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Stop talking right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:52.41,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,We want to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:54.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:57.42,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Let's wait till later when\NFujimoto isn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.07,Signs,Signs,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\bord3\c&H1DFFF8&\3c&H0800E0&\fnGyosho Script\frz321.368\pos(592,384)}New Product!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.07,Signs,Signs,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord3\b1\c&HFCFEF7&\fnGyosho Script\3c&HF4554D&\pos(132,81)}F R E E
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.07,Signs,Signs,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\b1\fnGyosho Script\c&H171211&\pos(295,289)\frz322.387}Have a Taste Campaign
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:51.75,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:59.42,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:54.60,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:00:59.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:03.20,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:06.00,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:13.34,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:18.92,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:22.76,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:26.30,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:29.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:32.10,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:37.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:40.16,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.75,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.51,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:49.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:56.13,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:02:00.14,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:04.79,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
