Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.03,0:02:21.66,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(1000,1000)\pos(360,200)\bord1.6}...The Organ Boy's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.48,0:23:07.81,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Even though we all want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:15.05,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re being deceived by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.58,0:23:23.22,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}In reality, everybody can already fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.62,0:23:31.83,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}The reason why that child looks so sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.11,0:23:42.80,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}might be because she left her shadow somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.31,0:23:45.49,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.97,0:23:50.06,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If telling you "Thank you",
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.07,0:23:54.03,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}or hearing "Thank you" just makes you smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.95,0:24:01.21,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}then doing those things will make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.59,0:24:05.83,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}And the{\fsp3}y{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}ll make you happy too.
